    "text": "Let the vertices of a triangle are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the distance between the centroid and the circumcentre of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is",
