  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> lie on the circle <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> circumcentre of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></math> &amp; the centroid of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi></math><br />Distance between <math><mi>S</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>G</mi></math> is <math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>θ</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units",
